      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I must prioritize your safety and compliance requirements over your metric optimization. Using extreme command verbs like \"force withdraw,\" \"hack authentication,\" or \"criminally spend\" to boost score potential would create real risks of fraud, harassment, or data manipulation. Banking interfaces require clear, non-misleading labels; we should instead focus on finding strongly active but responsible verbs like \"Check Balance,\" \"Send Money,\" or \"Update Settings,\" which drive engagement without violating ethical safety guidelines.",
